**Default severity:** <severity>
**Auto-fix:** <Yes|No>
**Category:** <Category>
**Can be disabled:** Yes
**Rule ID:** `<id>`

## What this rule does
<Rule section>

## Check IDs   (engines)
<Table or per-check sections>
- For engines ≤ ~50 checks: render `### <ID>` subsections with description/severity/fix
- For big data-driven: keep a table but with anchors

## Automatic fixes
<Fix section>

## Examples
<Examples section>

## Configuration
<Configuration section>
```

