Let me keep it clean: the generator emits a "Rule Table" section listing all check IDs with links to `<page>#<anchor>` grouped by category, plus keeps the data-driven tables (now linking to anchors too). Actually to avoid an enormous rules.md, I'll make the Rule Table list ALL check IDs but as a compact table grouped by category with a heading per category. It'll be long but complete and it's generated (no drift).

